<title>GERMANY: DYWIDAG SAYS H1 ORDERS ROSE 8.3 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>DYWIDAG SAYS H1 ORDERS ROSE 8.3 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output		1,997   up 11.1 pct</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    2,080   up 8.3 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German construction group is Dywidag AG. The company also said it expected stable profits for the full year and would pay an appropriate dividend.</p>
</text>
